cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Erupt in your research, please cite it as below.
title: "Erupt: annotation-driven low-code framework for Java admin backends"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Li
    given-names: YuePeng
    alias: erupts
repository-code: https://github.com/erupts/erupt
url: https://www.erupt.xyz
license: Apache-2.0
version: 2.3.0
date-released: 2026-09-25
keywords:
  - low-code
  - java
  - spring-boot
  - admin
  - annotation
  - code-as-configuration
abstract: >-
  Erupt generates a production-grade admin backend from annotated Java entities at
  runtime: UI, RBAC, audit logs and REST APIs with no code generation and no frontend
  code. It ships pluggable data connectors (JPA, MongoDB, Elasticsearch, LDAP, Redis,
  S3, Feishu, Notion and more) and AI-native modules built on langchain4j and MCP.
